   Let the ratio ratio of C, H, and N be 9x, 1x, and 3.5x.  
   The molecular mass of C is 12 g/mol, H is 1 g/mol, and N is 32 g/mol.  
   Total mass = (9x)(12) + (1x)(1) + (3.5x)(32) = 108  
