","a) **Series System**:  
In a series system, the system must not beencovered for the entire time \( t \) to be active.  
- The probability of failure for each component is \( 1 - \mu_i(t) \), where \( \mu_i(t) \) is the reliability function of component \( i \).  
- The probability of success for each component is \( \mu_i(t) \).  
