\[
\Delta S = (2 \times 66.5) + (2 \times 248.2) - (2 \times 91.2) - (3 \times 205.1)
\]
\[
\Delta S = (132 + 496.4) - (182.4 + 615.3)
\]
\[
\Delta S = 628.4 - 797.7
\]
\[
\Delta S = -169.3 \text{ J/mol K}
\]

Thus, the entropy change is \(\boxed{-169.3 \text{ J/mol K}}\).
</ASSISTANT_RESPONSE>

