   \]

2. **Calculate the area of each paving slice**:  
   \[
   \text{Area of each piece} = \frac{\text{Total area}}{\text{Number of pieces}} = \frac{812.5}{165} = 4.94 \text{ m}^2
   \]

3. **Use the area of one paving slice to find its width**:  
   \[
   \text{Area} = \text{Length} \times \text{Width} \implies 4.94 = 2.25 \times \text{width}
   \]
   \[
   \text{Width} = \frac{4.94}{2.25} = 2.22 \text{ m}
