\]

Substituting these into the transformed equation:

\[
j'_{i} = \sigma_{ij} e_{ij}
\]

The transformed conductivity tensor \( \sigma'_{ij} \) must satisfy:

\[
j'_{i} = \sigma'_{ij} e'_{ij}
\]

