   t₂ = 0.1 m / 1.27 x 10⁴ m/s
   t₂ ≈ 7.8 x 10⁻3 s

5. **Convert the flow times to seconds, seconds, and seconds**:
   t₁ ≈ 780 microseconds
   t₂ ≈ 7.8 milliseconds

