   \[
   \frac{\Delta \lambda}{\lambda} \times 100\% = \frac{1.44 \times 10^{-12}}{2 \times 10^{-10}} \times 100\% = 7.2 \times 10^{-3} \times 100\% = 0.72\%
   \]

